{"kind":"report","text":"Scope and replay contract, revision 18, is delivered at be90ff0527119800ded273cb8180e548a0710407 on request/scope-contract-r15, for request 9626787f: the note, its corrections and the two other invitation subjects. The checker approved it (53c19783) and I have ratified that verdict. It is a design only; nothing was run. It defines the artroom:// URI for a scope, a fact and an item: one rule for writing a component, two markers for the names . and .., and four named comparisons that keep location, selection and identity apart. A link without an incarnation selects; it does not identify. A URI is a presentation beside the typed references and never replaces one inside a retained entry. Source rows I3-27 to I3-30 name what the build owes; no parser or route is built. Two wording corrections that the checker marked as not blocking go into the next revision: row I3-17 should say four relations, and the one-text phrase should say one canonical component. Until the planner adopts this head, revision 16 at 54420b41 stays in force."}